Hive Shot Lab
Copyright 2026 Bolton Robotics FTC

This product was created by FIRST Tech Challenge team 36563 Prime Symmetry
(Bolton Robotics FTC) to measure BIOBUZZ pollen shots from slow-motion video:
launch speed, launch angle, and where each ball reaches the hive cell.

